<title>FINLAND: FINNISH ARSENAL TO ISSUE FIM 500 MLN 3-YR BOND.</title>
<headline>FINNISH ARSENAL TO ISSUE FIM 500 MLN 3-YR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-owned asset management company Omaisuudenhoitoyhtio Arsenal Oy said in a statement on Friday it will issue a three-year 500 million markka bond to institutional investors.  </p>
<p>Osuuspankkien Keskuspankki Oy OKOBANK is lead manager for the bond, Arsenal said.</p>
<p>The issue price will be floating. The coupon would be decided by October 10, one Arsenal executive said by telephone.</p>
<p>The bullet-type bond will be repaid in full on October 16, 1999, Arsenal said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
